# 🎓 College Chatbot — Powered by Groq & ChromaDB

> **AI-driven College Information Assistant**  
> An intelligent chatbot that learns from your college website and answers any inquiry using advanced LLMs from Groq, LangChain, and ChromaDB for context-based retrieval.

---

## 🌟 Overview

The **College Chatbot** automatically gathers your institution’s information from the website, processes and stores it using **semantic embeddings**, and provides a **natural-language chat interface** for quick, accurate answers.

### 💡 Key Features
- 🔍 **Smart Data Extraction** — Scrapes and cleans text from college web pages.  
- 🧠 **Semantic Search** — Embeds data into **ChromaDB** for fast, meaning-based retrieval.  
- 💬 **Conversational Interface** — Chat in plain English via a sleek **Streamlit UI**.  
- ⚙️ **Groq-Powered Reasoning** — Leverages **Llama 3.3 (70B)** or any Groq-hosted LLM.

---

## 🧩 Project Structure

| File             | Description                                                  |
|------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
| **scraper.py**    | Crawls and extracts text from college website pages.        |
| **ingest.py**     | Converts scraped data into vector embeddings & stores it.   |
| **model.py**      | Defines Groq-powered LLM interaction and QA logic.         |
| **app.py**        | Streamlit interface for user queries and real-time answers. |
| **requirements.txt** | Python dependencies for all modules.                   |
| **.env.example**  | Template for environment variables (API keys, model name). |
| **.env**          | Your actual secret keys (⚠️ Don’t share this!).             |

